Package: CausalMBSTS
Type: Package
Title: MBSTS Models for Causal Inference and Forecasting
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c( person("Iavor", "Bojinov", email = "ibojinov@hbs.edu",
        role = c("aut")), person("Fiammetta", "Menchetti", email =
        "fiammetta.menchetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Victoria L.", "Prince", email = "vliublinska@hbs.edu",
        role = "ctb"), person("Ista", "Zahn", email = "izahn@hbs.edu",
        role = "ctb"))
BugReports: https://github.com/FMenchetti/CausalMBSTS/issues
Description: Infers the causal effect of an intervention on a
        multivariate response through the use of Multivariate Bayesian
        Structural Time Series models (MBSTS) as described in Menchetti
        & Bojinov (2020) <arXiv:2006.12269>. The package also includes
        functions for model building and forecasting.
